-- Every university on YÖK's list (www.yok.gov.tr/university?type=1 and type=2, 28 Kasım 2026: 128
-- state, 74 foundation) not already in 0002_okullar.sql. Left out: Sakarya Üniversitesi and İstanbul
-- Gelişim Üniversitesi (skall is already there), and Bilkent and Beykent, listed in 0002 by their short
-- names. Names as Turkish Wikipedia spells them, else YÖK's in title case. name_key is forms.ts →
-- schoolKey(name) (forms.test.ts checks). On conflict a pending application for one of them is
-- approved (it is on YÖK's list); an approved or rejected row stays as it is.
on conflict (name_key) do update set status = 'approved' where schools.status = 'pending';
